# com.basis.mediaplayer
#
# What's in git: Runtime/Editor C#, asmdef, shader, package.json, LICENSE,
# THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES, the shipped native binaries in Plugins/, and the source
# needed to rebuild them (Native~/).
#
# What's NOT in git: locally generated build artifacts and the Unity PluginAPI
# headers (which ship with the editor, not this package).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Native plugin (basis_media_native) build artifacts.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Plugins/<platform>/basis_media_native.{dll,so} are shipped. Source lives in
# Native~/ for cross-platform rebuilds; build trees are local to each dev/CI.
Native~/build/
Native~/build-*/
Native~/CMakeUserPresets.json
Native~/CMakeCache.txt

# librist statics + headers are built from source (build-librist.{ps1,sh}) into
# third_party/, never committed. Keep the .gitkeep placeholders only.
Native~/third_party/win-x64/*
!Native~/third_party/win-x64/.gitkeep
Native~/third_party/android-arm64/*
!Native~/third_party/android-arm64/.gitkeep
Native~/third_party/include/librist/

# Unity PluginAPI headers copied locally for the native build (see unity/README.md).
Native~/unity/IUnityInterface.h
Native~/unity/IUnityGraphics.h
Native~/unity/IUnityGraphicsD3D11.h
Native~/unity/IUnityGraphicsD3D12.h
Native~/unity/IUnityGraphicsVulkan.h

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# C/C++ / MSVC / CMake leftovers (defensive — should already be under build/).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.obj
*.exp
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.idb
*.tlog
*.vcxproj.user
compile_commands.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IDE / editor caches that occasionally wander into a package directory.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
